# Test fixtures are byte-exact validator output. Small PNM files are plain
# ASCII headers followed by sample bytes that git's text heuristic may not
# flag as binary, so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf would rewrite
# their 0x0A bytes; mark every fixture type binary (no EOL conversion, no
# textual diff / merge).
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ppm binary
*.pgm binary
*.pnm binary
*.raw binary
*.bin binary
